msgid ""
"Printing several records together produces one merged file, which can\n"
"                    carry only one password. When the selected records do not share a password\n"
"                    the merged copy is produced without protection. Print a record on its own,\n"
"                    or use Send &amp; Print, to get a protected copy."
msgstr ""

